+         `↯/s.140.1.1` a `↯/s.140.1.3`: `CannotReadSource` (1) — _the upgrade source could not
+         be read_; `CannotWritePending` (2) — _the .pending file could not be written_;
+         `CannotResolveName` (3) — _the running application's name is not available_, que es
+         el caso de una JVM ejecutada sin lanzador.
+     entry .Reason   por qué no se pudo preparar el candidato

